  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "이 파크로우를 봐 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020D30CD06CB85CC6B0B97C0020BD100020C8FCC138C694002E00100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너덜너덜한 실크스카프를\n소중하게 간직하고 있더군요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108B35CB108B35CD55C0020C2E4D06CC2A4CE74D504B97C000AC18CC911D558AC8C0020AC04C9C1D558ACE00020C788B354AD70C694002E00100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "스카프의 주인을\n찾고 있는 것처럼 보이는데...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2A4CE74D504C7580020C8FCC778C744000ACC3EACE00020C788B2940020AC83CC98B7FC0020BCF4C774B294B370002E002E002E00100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "문제는 단서가 스카프에 자수로 새겨진\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>데스틴<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>이라는 이름뿐이란 말이죠.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB38C81CB2940020B2E8C11CAC000020C2A4CE74D504C5D00020C790C218B85C0020C0C8ACA8C9C4000A00100002FF000006B370C2A4D2F400100002FF000000C774B77CB2940020C774B984BFD0C774B7800020B9D0C774C8E0002E00100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "까아!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE4CC544002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "보셨죠? 방금처럼\n데스틴이라는 이름에 반응하고 있어요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCF4C168C8E0003F0020BC29AE08CC98B7FC000AB370C2A4D2F4C774B77CB2940020C774B984C5D00020BC18C751D558ACE00020C788C5B4C694002E00100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "혹시 지인 중에 스카프에 대해\n잘 아는 분은 없으신가요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D639C2DC0020C9C0C7780020C911C5D00020C2A4CE74D504C5D00020B300D574000AC7980020C544B2940020BD84C7400020C5C6C73CC2E0AC00C694003F00100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이노에게 물어본다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774B178C5D0AC8C0020BB3CC5B4BCF8B2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "루디에게 물어본다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B8E8B514C5D0AC8C0020BB3CC5B4BCF8B2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "스카프?\n그런 거라면 이노가 더 잘 알지 않을까?<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n도움이 못 돼서 미안!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2A4CE74D504003F000AADF8B7F00020AC70B77CBA740020C774B178AC000020B3540020C7980020C54CC9C00020C54AC744AE4C003F00100001BE00000AB3C4C6C0C7740020BABB0020B3FCC11C0020BBF8C5480021001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "스카프 말씀이신가요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2A4CE74D5040020B9D0C500C774C2E0AC00C694003F001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "천이나 옷감에 대한 건 그럭저럭 알지만\n스카프만 보고 주인을 찾는 건 무리예요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CC9CC774B0980020C637AC10C5D00020B300D55C0020AC740020ADF8B7EDC800B7ED0020C54CC9C0B9CC000AC2A4CE74D504B9CC0020BCF4ACE00020C8FCC778C7440020CC3EB2940020AC740020BB34B9ACC608C694002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇지,\n조미 씨에게 물어보는 건 어떨까요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807C9C0002C000AC870BBF80020C528C5D0AC8C0020BB3CC5B4BCF4B2940020AC740020C5B4B5A8AE4CC694003F001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메종 드 포르테의 조미 씨는 행동은 좀\n부담스럽긴 해도 프로 디자이너이신 만큼,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n다양한 천에 대해 알고 있거든요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54C8850020B4DC0020D3ECB974D14CC7580020C870BBF80020C528B2940020D589B3D9C7400020C880000ABD80B2F4C2A4B7FDAE340020D574B3C40020D504B85C0020B514C790C774B108C774C2E00020B9CCD07C002C00100001BE00000AB2E4C591D55C0020CC9CC5D00020B300D5740020C54CACE00020C788AC70B4E0C694002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 씨라면\n스카프의 주인을 찾을 수 있을 거예요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000000020C528B77CBA74000AC2A4CE74D504C7580020C8FCC778C7440020CC3EC7440020C2180020C788C7440020AC70C608C694002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "실마리는 찾은 것 같군요.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n파크로우를 위해서라도\n스카프의 주인을 찾아 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2E4B9C8B9ACB2940020CC3EC7400020AC830020AC19AD70C694002E00100001BE01000AD30CD06CB85CC6B0B97C0020C704D574C11CB77CB3C4000AC2A4CE74D504C7580020C8FCC778C7440020CC3EC5440020C8FCC138C694002E00100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "파크로우를 위해서라도\n스카프의 주인을 찾아 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D30CD06CB85CC6B0B97C0020C704D574C11CB77CB3C4000AC2A4CE74D504C7580020C8FCC778C7440020CC3EC5440020C8FCC138C694002E00100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "까아!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE4CC544002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "지나가던 디자이너\n조미라고 해요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9C0B098AC00B3580020B514C790C774B108000AC870BBF8B77CACE00020D574C694002E001000020114003A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "또 메가진화를 사용하는 스타일리시한\n포켓몬 승부를 하러 오셨나요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B6100020BA54AC00C9C4D654B97C0020C0ACC6A9D558B2940020C2A4D0C0C77CB9ACC2DCD55C000AD3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80B97C0020D558B7EC0020C624C168B098C694003F001000020114003A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이 스카프를 봐 주세요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020C2A4CE74D504B97C0020BD100020C8FCC138C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이 스카프를 봐 주세요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020C2A4CE74D504B97C0020BD100020C8FCC138C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이 스카프를 봐 주세요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020C2A4CE74D504B97C0020BD100020C8FCC138C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제게 감정을 의뢰하시다니,\n저를 디자이너로서 신용하고 있다는 거군요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81CAC8C0020AC10C815C7440020C758B8B0D558C2DCB2E4B2C8002C000AC800B97C0020B514C790C774B108B85CC11C0020C2E0C6A9D558ACE00020C788B2E4B2940020AC70AD70C694002E001000020114003A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이 스카프는...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020C2A4CE74D504B294002E002E002E001000020114003A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제법 더러워지긴 했지만\n디자인과 사용된 천으로 미루어 봤을 때<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n가라르지방의 슛시티에 있는 학교에서\n신입생들에게 나눠 준 스카프 같군요.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n그것도 3년 전 디자인이네요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이 스카프는 어디에서 나신 거죠?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020C2A4CE74D504B2940020C5B4B514C5D0C11C0020B098C2E00020AC70C8E0003F001000020114003A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "파크로우가 가지고 있었어요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D30CD06CB85CC6B0AC000020AC00C9C0ACE00020C788C5C8C5B4C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "주인을 찾고 있어요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C8FCC778C7440020CC3EACE00020C788C5B4C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "자수에 새겨진 이름의 주인을 찾고 있다니...\n정말 스타일리시한 이야기군요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C790C218C5D00020C0C8ACA8C9C40020C774B984C7580020C8FCC778C7440020CC3EACE00020C788B2E4B2C8002E002E002E000AC815B9D00020C2A4D0C0C77CB9ACC2DCD55C0020C774C57CAE30AD70C6940021001000020114003A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇다면 에투알 스쿨에서\n찾아 보시는 게 어떨까요?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n스카프의 주인이 미르에 있다면\n에투알 스쿨에 다니고 있을 거예요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807B2E4BA740020C5D0D22CC54C0020C2A4CFE8C5D0C11C000ACC3EC5440020BCF4C2DCB2940020AC8C0020C5B4B5A8AE4CC694003F00100001BE01000AC2A4CE74D504C7580020C8FCC778C7740020BBF8B974C5D00020C788B2E4BA74000AC5D0D22CC54C0020C2A4CFE8C5D00020B2E4B2C8ACE00020C788C7440020AC70C608C694002E001000020114003A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "스카프의 주인이 미르에 있다면\n에투알 스쿨에 다니고 있을 거예요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2A4CE74D504C7580020C8FCC778C7740020BBF8B974C5D00020C788B2E4BA74000AC5D0D22CC54C0020C2A4CFE8C5D00020B2E4B2C8ACE00020C788C7440020AC70C608C694002E001000020114003A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "까아아!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE4CC544C544002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뭐야 이 파크로우는...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB50C57C0020C7740020D30CD06CB85CC6B0B294002E002E002E00100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "설마, 너...!\n그때 그 파라꼬야!?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C124B9C8002C0020B108002E002E002E0021000AADF8B54C0020ADF80020D30CB77CAF2CC57C0021003F00100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "까아!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE4CC54400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "말도 안 돼!\n우리가 만난 건 가라르지방에서였잖아!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n바다를 건너서 여기까지 온 거야?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9D0B3C40020C5480020B3FC0021000AC6B0B9ACAC000020B9CCB09C0020AC740020AC00B77CB974C9C0BC29C5D0C11CC600C796C544002100100001BE00000ABC14B2E4B97C0020AC74B108C11C0020C5ECAE30AE4CC9C00020C6280020AC70C57C003F00100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "까아!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE4CC54400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "다쳤었으면서...\n몸집도 작았으면서...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4CCE4C5C8C73CBA74C11C002E002E002E000ABAB8C9D1B3C40020C791C558C73CBA74C11C002E002E002E00100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미르로 이사 간\n나를 찾으러 온 거야?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B974B85C0020C774C0AC0020AC04000AB098B97C0020CC3EC73CB7EC0020C6280020AC70C57C003F00100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "넌 정말 최고야!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 3040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B10C0020C815B9D00020CD5CACE0C57C002100100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "까아!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 3068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE4CC54400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "트레이너님! 파크로우를 위해\n제가 있는 곳을 찾아 주신 거죠?<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n정말 감사해요!!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 3076,
