      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "파크로우는\n제가 파트너로 삼아도 될까요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 3180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D30CD06CB85CC6B0B294000AC81CAC000020D30CD2B8B108B85C0020C0BCC544B3C40020B420AE4CC694003F00100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "물론이지!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 3236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB3CB860C774C9C000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "파크로우도 기뻐할 거야",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 3248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D30CD06CB85CC6B0B3C40020AE30BED0D5600020AC70C57C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "부탁 하나만 더 들어주실 수 있나요?\n제 파크로우와 승부해 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 3276,
