      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿9",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 3664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "파크로우...\n지긴 했지만 넌 정말 최고였어!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n너에게 어울리는\n트레이너가 될 수 있게 열심히 할게!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 3676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D30CD06CB85CC6B0002E002E002E000AC9C0AE340020D588C9C0B9CC0020B10C0020C815B9D00020CD5CACE0C600C5B4002100100001BE01000AB108C5D0AC8C0020C5B4C6B8B9ACB294000AD2B8B808C774B108AC000020B4200020C2180020C788AC8C0020C5F4C2ECD7880020D560AC8C002100100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "세상에나! 너 진짜 강하구나!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n너에게 어울리는\n트레이너가 될 수 있게 열심히 할게!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
